Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.WEB_PAGE.WP_CREATION_DATE_SK,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_PAGE 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.WEB_PAGE.WP_ACCESS_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.WEB_PAGE.WP_CREATION_DATE_SK <= 2450811 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_PAGE.WP_ACCESS_DATE_SK >= 2452574


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.WP_CREATION_DATE_SK AS "WP_CREATION_DATE_SK",
  Q2.D_DATE_SK AS "D_DATE_SK" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_PAGE AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.WP_ACCESS_DATE_SK) AND 
  (2452574 <= Q1.WP_ACCESS_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q1.WP_CREATION_DATE_SK <= 2450811)

Explain level:    Explain from section

